sequenceDiagram
    participant LLM as Agent Orchestrator
    participant Middleware as Tool Access Middleware
    participant Policy as MCP Governance Policy
    participant Server as MCP Server (Local FS, DB)

    LLM->>Middleware: Execute tool_call: read_file(path: "/.env")
    
    Middleware->>Policy: Check tool authorization
    Policy-->>Middleware: Authorized
    
    Middleware->>Policy: Inspect payload (path: "/.env")
    Policy-->>Middleware: DENIED (Path Blacklisted)
    
    Middleware-->>LLM: Throw Exception (Security Violation)
    Note over Middleware,LLM: Request physically blocked before reaching server.

    LLM->>Middleware: Execute tool_call: read_file(path: "/src/utils.ts")
    Middleware->>Policy: Inspect payload (path: "/src/utils.ts")
    Policy-->>Middleware: Allowed
    
    Middleware->>Server: Forward execution request
    Server-->>Middleware: Return file contents
    Middleware-->>LLM: Pass contents to context window
